OL,3,GNEWSA'Extra special' tamarin twins born
OL,4,Aat zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's smallest accredited
OL,7,Fzoos is celebrating after "extra
OL,8,Fspecial" pied tamarin twins were born
OL,9,Fat the site.
OL,11,FShaldon Wildlife Trust, in Devon, said
OL,12,Fthe critically endangered twins were
OL,13,Fborn on 29 September to mum Bobby and
OL,14,Fdad Pedra. Its director, Zak Showell,
OL,15,Fsaid it was a "challenge" to breed the
OL,16,Fspecies.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
