OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Extra special' tamarin twins born
OL,4,Aat zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said the animals were among
OL,7,Fthe most endangered primates in South
OL,8,FAmerica. Bosses said the infants were
OL,9,F"thriving" and had started to hitch
OL,10,Frides on their parents' backs as they
OL,11,Fexplored their habitat.
OL,13,FShowell said: "For a zoo of our size to
OL,14,Fachieve this and to be one of just two
OL,15,FEuropean zoos to manage it this year is
OL,16,Fan unbelievable proud moment for our
OL,17,Fsmall team."
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
